<title>UK: Morgan Stanley prices 138 mln stg two-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley prices 138 mln stg two-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following asset-backed two-tranche bond has been priced, lead manager Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AUTOLINK CONCESSIONAIRES MG PLC</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A1</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  FINANCIAL SECURITY ASSURANCE UK LTD  (AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   COUPON     8.39	MATURITY    15.JUN.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE  S-08.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    100	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.50	SPREAD     +62 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100</p>
<p> NOTES	 SENIOR AND SECURED</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B1</p>
<p> AMT    13.8 MLN STG  COUPON     11.27     MATURITY    15.JUN.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE  S-08.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  NONE	REOFFER    100	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> SPREAD     +350 BP   DENOMS (K)</p>
<p> NOTES	 SUBORDINATED AND SECURED</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ   SEMI ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS UK	 TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2015 UK GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
